== History ==
2026
* On 2/3/2026, with the [[Version History#Pass Royale and more (2/3/2026)|March 2026 update]], Hero Magic Archer Was added to the game along with [[Barbarian Barrel/Hero|Hero Barbarian Barrel]]{{Balance|Add}}.
* On 7/4/2026, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (7/4/2026)|Balance Update]], increased the Hero Magic Archer's ability cost to 2 elixir (from 1 elixir){{Balance|Nerf}}.
* On 6/7/2026, a [[Version History#Pass Royale and more (6/7/2026)|Balance Update]], decreased the Hero Magic Archer's ability range to 13.5 tiles (from 15.4 tiles){{Balance|Nerf}}, decreased his teleportation distance to 3.5 tiles (from 5 tiles){{Balance|Nerf}}, and decreased the decoy hitpoints by 57%{{Balance|Nerf}}.
* On 4/8/2026, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (4/8/2026)|Balance Update]], decreased the Hero Magic Archer's damage by 6%{{Balance|Nerf}}. This also made the ability single use (from 25sec cooldown){{Balance|Remove}}.

